### TanStack Query Hooks

#### [NEW] [useDocuments.ts](file:///home/krishna/projects/otis/frontend/otis-ui/src/hooks/useDocuments.ts)

```typescript
// useQuery wrapper around getAllUserDocuments()
// staleTime: 5 minutes (docs rarely change)
// gcTime: 10 minutes
// Returns { documents, isLoading, error, ... }
```

#### [NEW] [useUploadDocument.ts](file:///home/krishna/projects/otis/frontend/otis-ui/src/hooks/useUploadDocument.ts)

```typescript
// useMutation around uploadUserDocuments()
// onSuccess: use queryClient.setQueryData to prepend new docs to cache
// Returns { uploadDocuments, isUploading, ... }
```

#### [NEW] [useDeleteDocuments.ts](file:///home/krishna/projects/otis/frontend/otis-ui/src/hooks/useDeleteDocuments.ts)

```typescript
// useMutation around deleteDocumentsFromProject()
// onSuccess: use queryClient.setQueryData to remove deleted docs from cache
// Returns { deleteDocuments, isDeleting, ... }
```

---

### Refactor Data Library

#### [MODIFY] [data-library.tsx](file:///home/krishna/projects/otis/frontend/otis-ui/src/pages/data-library.tsx)

- Remove [documents](file:///home/krishna/projects/otis/frontend/otis-ui/src/components/features/documents)/`isLoading` `useState` + `useEffect`/[loadDocuments](file:///home/krishna/projects/otis/frontend/otis-ui/src/pages/data-library.tsx#66-78)
- Use `useDocuments()` → `{ documents, isLoading }`
- Replace [handleUpload](file:///home/krishna/projects/otis/frontend/otis-ui/src/pages/data-library.tsx#121-153) body with `useUploadDocument().uploadDocuments(files)`
- Replace [executeDelete](file:///home/krishna/projects/otis/frontend/otis-ui/src/pages/data-library.tsx#188-215) body with `useDeleteDocuments().deleteDocuments()`
- Keep `isUploading`/`isDeleting` derived from mutation `isPending`
- Keep UI-only state (`selectedDocs`, `searchQuery`, `viewMode`, etc.) in `useState`

---

### Wire Mentions to Real Data

#### [MODIFY] [chat-page.tsx](file:///home/krishna/projects/otis/frontend/otis-ui/src/components/features/chat/chat-page.tsx)

- Import and call `useDocuments()`
- Map `Document[]` → `MentionItem[]` (`{ id: doc.doc_id, label: doc.filename }`)
- Replace static `MOCK_DOCUMENTS` with the mapped live data in `MENTION_TRIGGERS`
- Use `useMemo` to memoize the triggers array so it only recomputes when documents change

#### [MODIFY] [mention-types.ts](file:///home/krishna/projects/otis/frontend/otis-ui/src/components/features/mention/mention-types.ts)

- Remove the `MOCK_DOCUMENTS` export (dead code after above change)

#### [MODIFY] [index.ts](file:///home/krishna/projects/otis/frontend/otis-ui/src/components/features/mention/index.ts)

- Remove `MOCK_DOCUMENTS` re-export

