## Verification Plan

### Build Check
```bash
cd /home/krishna/projects/otis/frontend/otis-ui && npm run build
```
The project must compile with zero TypeScript errors.

### Manual Verification

> [!IMPORTANT]
> No automated tests exist in this project. Verification is manual via the dev server.

1. **Start dev server**: `cd /home/krishna/projects/otis/frontend/otis-ui && npm run dev`
2. **Data Library page** (`/data-library`):
   - Documents should load on page visit
   - Navigate away and back — documents should appear instantly from cache (no loading skeleton flash)
   - Upload a file — it should appear immediately without a page refresh
   - Delete a file — it should disappear immediately
3. **Chat mention dropdown** (`/` or `/c/:chatId`):
   - Type `@` in the chat input — real documents from the API should appear in the dropdown (not mock data)
   - Type `@par` — dropdown should filter by filename
   - Upload a document on the Data Library page, navigate to chat, type `@` — newly uploaded doc should appear without any separate API call
